<title>SPAIN: Spain's Rato details 97 budget at 0830 GMT Monday.</title>
<headline>Spain's Rato details 97 budget at 0830 GMT Monday.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spain's Economy Minister Rodrigo Rato will detail the 1997 budget at 0830 GMT on Monday after its official presentation to parliament, a spokesman for the ministry said.</p>
<p>Rato told journalists the broad outlines of the budget earlier today after the cabinet approved the draft.</p>
<p>--Madrid Newsroom +34 1 585 2167</p>
</text>
